1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:05,854
Ek mahine mein mehengai 4.83% se seedha 5.54% pe pahunch gayi.

2
00:00:05,804 --> 00:00:08,534
Aur sabse bada jhatka aapki thali pe hai.

3
00:00:08,665 --> 00:00:12,235
MoSPI ka CPI aapke ghar ki tokri ka daam naapta hai.

4
00:00:12,317 --> 00:00:16,867
Khaane ki mehengai 5.97% se 7.74% pe aa gayi.

5
00:00:16,843 --> 00:00:19,773
Pyaaz saal bhar mein 108% mehenga.

6
00:00:19,623 --> 00:00:21,493
Aloo aur tamatar thode saste.

7
00:00:21,625 --> 00:00:25,743
Gaon mein mehengai 6.08% shehar mein 4.88%.

8
00:00:25,843 --> 00:00:30,473
RBI ne repo rate 5.25 se badhakar 5.50% kar diya.

9
00:00:30,454 --> 00:00:33,804
FY27 ka anuman 5.2% hai.

10
00:00:33,654 --> 00:00:35,224
Anuman hai, guarantee nahi.

11
00:00:35,363 --> 00:00:38,213
Asli return matlab return minus mehengai.

12
00:00:38,063 --> 00:00:42,476
7% ki FD pe asli kamai sirf 1.46%.

13
00:00:42,526 --> 00:00:45,076
Aapki thali mein sabse mehenga kya hua?

14
00:00:45,066 --> 00:00:45,736
Comment karo.

